  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add quinoa and cook for 2 minutes, until lightly toasted.",
    "Add oyster mushrooms and cook for 3-4 minutes, until they release their liquid and start to brown.",
    "Add artichoke hearts, olives, lemon juice, and feta cheese. Stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15-20 minutes, or until quinoa is tender and liquid has been absorbed.",
    "Stir in chopped parsley and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot in individual bento boxes."
